  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato into small cubes.\n• Place sweet potato on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle with all-purpose seasoning and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat, spread out evenly and roast until just tender, 20 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645d7366cc8355eef1064d0d/step-194f931c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic. Grate carrot. Drain sweetcorn. Drain and rinse black beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook corn, black beans and 1/2 the carrot until softened, 3-4 mins.\n• Add garlic, spicy taco seasoning (add less if you're sensitive to heat!) and the butter and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645d7366cc8355eef1064d0d/step-9f6b0dfe.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add passata and the water to the frying pan and cook until slightly reduced, 2-3 mins. Season to taste.\n• Transfer bean mixture to a baking dish. Top with roasted sweet potato and sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.\n• Bake until cheese has melted and bean mixture is bubbling, 8-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645d7366cc8355eef1064d0d/step-e8fd85d7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, toss salad leaves, remaining carrot and a drizzle of olive oil and white wine vinegar. Season.\n• Divide Mexican bean bake between bowls. Top with yoghurt. Serve with salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645d7366cc8355eef1064d0d/step-249006a2.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
